  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Vegan</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Natural Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Good for: Dark Circles</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Medium Coverage</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Long-wearing</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ allure 2026 Best of Beauty Award Winner</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A long-wearing liquid concealer with buildable, medium coverage that quickly brightens and blurs the under-eyes and complexion.<br><br><b>Coverage: </b>Medium <br><b><br>Finish: </b>Natural <br><b><br>Formulation: </b>Liquid <br><b><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></b>- Sodium Hyaluronate: Provides intense hydration and supports skin elasticity.<br>- Vitamin E: For soothing skin, moisture retention, antioxidant protection.<br>- Tetrahexyldecyl Palmitate: Softens, smooths, and supports the skin barrier while enhancing blendability.<br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> Free of parabens, formaldehydes, formaldehyde-releasing agents, phthalates, mineral oil, retinyl palmitate, oxybenzone, coal tar, hydroquinone, sulfates SLS & SLES, and contains less than one pe</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Brighten and conceal with the doe-foot applicator.<br>-Use the dense end of PATRICK TA&rsquo;s Dual-Ended Concealer Brush to blend with precision, then use the rounded, fluffy end to softly diffuse the formula. <br><br>Patrick&rsquo;s Signature Placements: <br>1. Inner corners of the eyes to the apples of the cheeks.<br>2. Outer edges of the eyes.<br>3. Down the smile lines.<br>4. Along the sides of the bottom lip.<br>5. Center of the forehead between the eyebrows.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Sodium Hyaluronate: Provides intense hydration and supports skin elasticity.<br>-Vitamin E: For soothing skin, moisture retention, antioxidant protection.<br>-Tetrahexyldecyl Palmitate: Softens, smooths, and supports the skin barrier while enhancing blendability.<br><br>Aqua/Water/Eau, Isononyl Isononanoate, Dimethicone, Polyglyceryl-3 Polyricinoleate, C13-15 Alkane, Trimethylsiloxysilicate, Propanediol, Diisostearyl Malate, Dipentaerythrityl Hexahydroxystearate/Hexastearate/Hexarosinate, Disteardimonium Hectorite, PEG-10 Dimethicone, Dimethicone Crosspolymer, Triethoxycaprylylsilane, Magnesium Sulfate, Tocopheryl Acetate, Betaine, Sorbitan Sesquioleate, Tetrahexyldecyl Ascorbate, Ethylhexylglycerin, Silica, Sodium Hyaluronate, Phenoxyethanol, Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891), Iron Oxides (CI 77492),  Iron Oxides (CI 77491), Iron Oxides (CI 77499), Bismuth Oxychloride (CI 77163).</div></details>",
